CI/CD: CI/CD is an automated assembly line for software development instead of developers manually building, testing and uploading code to server.
CI/CD piplines automates those task so code updates and go live smoothly in minutes or hours.

- Continous Integration
- Continous Delivery
- Continous Deployment

Jenkins CI/CD:
Jenkins is an self hosted automation server which is used for continous integration and continous delivery.
Unlike modern cloud-native-tools like GitLab CI/CD and Github action - which come fully hosted and managed for us. Jenkins is an software that you install, host and manage on your own server and clous infrastructure.
 
 
